There is an unblocked exit to the south.".
The description of r_90 is "[serious office 7 part 0]".

The r_42 is mapped south of r_90.
Understand "spacious pantry" as r_91.
The internal name of r_91 is "spacious pantry".
The printed name of r_91 is "-= Spacious Pantry =-".
The spacious pantry part 0 is some text that varies. The spacious pantry part 0 is "You've just walked into a spacious pantry.



You need an unblocked exit? You should try going south.".
The description of r_91 is "[spacious pantry part 0]".

The r_43 is mapped south of r_91.
Understand "gloomy vault" as r_92.
The internal name of r_92 is "gloomy vault".
The printed name of r_92 is "-= Gloomy Vault =-".
The gloomy vault part 0 is some text that varies. The gloomy vault part 0 is "You are in a vault. It seems to be pretty gloomy here.



There is an exit to the north. Don't worry, it is unblocked.".
The description of r_92 is "[gloomy vault part 0]".

The r_44 is mapped north of r_92.
Understand "super hot cookery" as r_95.
The internal name of r_95 is "super hot cookery".
The printed name of r_95 is "-= Super Hot Cookery =-".
The super hot cookery part 0 is some text that varies. The super hot cookery part 0 is "This might come as a shock to you, but you've just walked into a super hot cookery.



You don't like doors? Why not try going south, that entranceway is unguarded.".
The description of r_95 is "[super hot cookery part 0]".

The r_47 is mapped south of r_95.

